msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"(...Hey, what about her? As far as being a hostess goes, she\r\n"
"might be a good fit. Let's see here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"(She takes care of herself fairly well, and I sense that\r\n"
"she's really smart... I doubt she'd be fazed by a stressful\r\n"
"day on the job, either... Should I ask her to join?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "(On second thought... maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Ripensandoci... Magari no.)"

msgctxt "172"
msgid "(Okay, let's see what I can come up with...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Sorry to interrupt whatever you're doing, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "...Huh? Oh! Are you talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Oh yes. You see, I was minding my own business, when all of\r\n"
"a sudden, I found myself drawn to your overwhelming beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Nooooo.... You really mean that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Of course I do. Now, I'm sure you get this all the time, but\r\n"
"have you ever been interested in working as a hostess?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"No, actually! You're the first one who's asked! And yeah,\r\n"
"I guess I'd be open to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"All right. Then would you mind coming by our club? I'd be\r\n"
"more than happy to explain the details there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Okay, then! I'm Kirie. 22 years old and looking to broaden\r\n"
"my horizons. It's really nice to meet you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Likewise. Let me show you the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Approach Her"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Hold That Thought"
msgstr ""

